WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.117
Doors open. Here is how check-in works.

2
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.800
Every guest has a pass on their phone.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.289
In the queue, scan it from the Team portal.

4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.676
One tick, and they're checked in.

5
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.158
Their phone tells them straight away.

6
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.679
Now watch. The name runs ahead to the desk.

7
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.172
It joins the list, in the order people were scanned.

8
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.240
So the desk gets each lanyard ready before the guest arrives.

9
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.226
Hand it over, and tap Given.

10
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.411
The name clears on every phone, and the guest gets one last note.

11
00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.733
Scan. Prepare. Given.
